# Impeccable (design anti-pattern detector).
# The CI gate runs the version-pinned npm devDependency, so nothing here is
# needed to enforce quality — these are the agent-authoring conveniences.
#   .claude/skills/impeccable/ is 2.8MB of third-party code with no bundled
#   licence; install it yourself rather than vendoring it into an MIT repo:
#     npx impeccable install --providers=claude --scope=project
# .impeccable/config.json IS committed — the scoped suppressions and their
# stated reasons are project truth and must be shared.
.claude/skills/impeccable/
.impeccable/config.local.json
.impeccable/cache/
